{"schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "1eeda39a-b62e-4604-b917-e6c96cb5c57a", "team_id": "contest2026_062_PharosTech", "github_login": "yunline", "tool": "copilot", "seq": 3, "ts": "2026-07-21T17:24:12.241000+00:00", "role": "tool", "text": "replace_string_in_file: /home/yunline/projects/ovela-dev-workspace/contest2026_062_PharosTech/chips/rk3576/include/chip.h", "tool_name": "replace_string_in_file", "tool_call_id": "db-replace_string_in_file-2", "files_touched": ["/home/yunline/projects/ovela-dev-workspace/contest2026_062_PharosTech/chips/rk3576/include/chip.h"]}
{"schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "1eeda39a-b62e-4604-b917-e6c96cb5c57a", "team_id": "contest2026_062_PharosTech", "github_login": "yunline", "tool": "copilot", "seq": 4, "ts": "2026-07-21T17:24:12.241000+00:00", "role": "assistant", "text": "所有修改已完成。以下是变更总结：\n\n---\n\n## 修改总结\n\n### 问题\n`kickpi-k7` 开发板的 DDR 容量在 `chip.h` 中硬编码为 4GB，但该板实际支持 4G/8G/16G 三种 DDR 配置。\n\n### 修改的文件（3 个）\n\n**1. `contest2026_062_PharosTech/boards/rk3576/kickpi-k7/Kconfig`**\n添加了 `choice` 菜单供用户选择 DDR 容量（4G/8G/16G），并通过内部 `int` 配置 `KICKPI_K7_DDR_SIZE_GB` 暴露实际 GB 值。\n\n**2. `contest2026_062_PharosTech/chips/rk3576/include/chip.h`**\n- `CONFIG_RAMBANK2_SIZE` 从硬编码 `GB(4) - ...` 改为 `GB(CONFIG_KICKPI_K7_DDR_SIZE_GB) - ...`\n- 更新了注释，去除对 4GB 的硬编码描述\n\n**3. `contest2026_062_PharosTech/boards/rk3576/kickpi-k7/configs/nsh/defconfig`**\n添加了 `CONFIG_KICKPI_K7_DDR_4G=y` 作为默认值（保持向后兼容）\n\n### 使用方式\n用户可通过 `menuconfig` → \"KICKPI-K7 DDR Capacity\" 选择对应容量，或直接修改 defconfig：\n- `CONFIG_KICKPI_K7_DDR_4G=y` → 4GB\n- `CONFIG_KICKPI_K7_DDR_8G=y` → 8GB  \n- `CONFIG_KICKPI_K7_DDR_16G=y` → 16GB\n\n`CONFIG_RAMBANK2_SIZE` 会自动根据选择计算：`DDR总容量 - OP-TEE(16MB) - bank1(132MB)`。"}
{"schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "1eeda39a-b62e-4604-b917-e6c96cb5c57a", "team_id": "contest2026_062_PharosTech", "github_login": "yunline", "tool": "copilot", "seq": 5, "ts": "2026-07-21T17:29:33.310000+00:00", "role": "user", "text": "注意到nuttx有定义一个配置项Board memory range，这个是做什么的？"}
